# Home Assistant App: Grafana with VictoriaMetrics datasource

The open platform for beautiful analytics and monitoring with VictoriaMetrics datasource support.

## About

Grafana allows you to query, visualize, alert on, and understand your metrics no matter where they are stored. Create, explore, and share dashboards for your Home Assistant environment.

This independently maintained App is based on the Home Assistant Community App for Grafana and includes the official `victoriametrics-metrics-datasource` plugin in the image.

For configuration and usage details, see `DOCS.md`.
